  "body_html": "<h1>Brouwer Fixed Point Theorem For A Simplex</h1>\n<p>Every continuous map\n$$\n  f:\\Delta\\to\\Delta\n$$\nfrom a simplex to itself has a fixed point.</p>\n<h2>References</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>[MFoGT, Cor. 4.11.2] Laraki, Renault, and Sorin, <em>Mathematical Foundations of Game Theory</em>, <code>references/MathFoundationsGameTheory.pdf</code>. Continuous self-map of a simplex has a fixed point.</li>\n</ul>",
